        <mxCell id="Y22VKz-_8rxfGPT2uMRH-2" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3507" y="755" width="898" height="622.19" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Generation of cisTarget database&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;. For the generation of the cisTarget database, a matrix with regions as rows (clusters of) motifs as columns and either raw scores (DEM) or ranking of these scores (cisTarget) was generated by scoring the DNA sequence of consensus peaks using Cluster-Buster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; aria-label=&quot;Reference 87&quot; title=&quot;Frith, M. C. Cluster-Buster: finding dense clusters of motifs in DNA sequences. Nucleic Acids Res. 31, 3666–3668 (2003).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41592-023-01938-4#ref-CR87&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d32509217e1971&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em; font-size: 25px;&quot;&gt;87&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;. Briefly, Cluster-Buster uses HMMs to score clusters of motifs given a set of DNA sequences. Each motif within a cluster is used as a separate hidden state in the model. Cluster-Buster was run separately for each (cluster of) motif(s) on the DNA sequence of all consensus peaks and the maximum cis-regulatory module score per region was used as the score for each region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" link="&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Generation of cisTarget database&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;. For the generation of the cisTarget database, a matrix with regions as rows (clusters of) motifs as columns and either raw scores (DEM) or ranking of these scores (cisTarget) was generated by scoring the DNA sequence of consensus peaks using Cluster-Buster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 0; position: relative; top: -0.5em; box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-action=&quot;reference anchor&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-test=&quot;citation-ref&quot; aria-label=&quot;Reference 87&quot; title=&quot;Frith, M. C. Cluster-Buster: finding dense clusters of motifs in DNA sequences. Nucleic Acids Res. 31, 3666–3668 (2003).&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41592-023-01938-4#ref-CR87&quot; id=&quot;ref-link-section-d32509217e1971&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: underline 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.08em;&quot;&gt;87&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;. Briefly, Cluster-Buster uses HMMs to score clusters of motifs given a set of DNA sequences. Each motif within a cluster is used as a separate hidden state in the model. Cluster-Buster was run separately for each (cluster of) motif(s) on the DNA sequence of all consensus peaks and the maximum cis-regulatory module score per region was used as the score for each region.&lt;/span&gt;" id="Y22VKz-_8rxfGPT2uMRH-5">
